    "title": "Two candidates qualify to fill Maxeys' city council seat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 days ago Maxeys voters will choose between Mark Whiting and Warren Gilson on Nov. 3 in a special election to fill Carrie Hyatt’s vacant city council seat. Hyatt resigned in September after moving to Arizona with her husband. The Maxeys Municipal Charter requires a special election because the vacancy occurred more than six months before the next regular election. Read full article\n1",
